;; past `d7105581` -- measured: rebuilt at amu `ed78ffd1`, all four report
;; `SCANNED 4 self-tail-loops=47 objects-with-findings=0`.
;;
;; The rebuild belongs to the object-attestation stream (ADR-0150 decision 3),
;; not here. When it lands, delete the cleared entries; the checker exits 4 and
;; names them rather than passing quietly over a baseline that has gone stale.
